WEBVTT

01:44.062 --> 01:46.395
Hi, hon.

01:55.797 --> 02:00.954
[LOVE IN THE BIG CITY]

02:05.057 --> 02:07.474
- Hello.
- Nice to meet you.

02:25.895 --> 02:28.478
Hi, I'm Chul Gu. What's your dream?

02:29.937 --> 02:32.353
I want to be a diplomat.

02:42.103 --> 02:44.562
- What the hell!
- Who's that?

02:51.051 --> 02:52.634
Hello.

03:11.297 --> 03:13.505
Cheers! Bottoms up!

03:13.505 --> 03:15.422
Bottoms up!

03:18.005 --> 03:19.588
Cheers!

03:23.630 --> 03:26.630
You're from Paris? Where did you live?

03:26.630 --> 03:30.547
First in the 15th,
then at a friend's in Belleville.

03:30.547 --> 03:33.047
Belleville! That's nice.

03:33.047 --> 03:35.213
Yes, it was way better than the 15th.

03:35.213 --> 03:37.588
Why are you majoring in French?

03:37.588 --> 03:39.173
Because I like Albert Camus.

03:39.173 --> 03:42.089
What? Camus was Moroccan.

03:43.046 --> 03:45.529
He was Algerian.

03:45.529 --> 03:47.822
I mean he's not a French literary.

03:47.822 --> 03:50.005
Dang!

03:50.005 --> 03:51.672
But he wrote in French.

03:51.672 --> 03:52.880
Hey!

03:52.880 --> 03:55.505
In the army, if you play soccer with a general,

03:55.505 --> 03:58.547
- Let's get a smoke.
- you can't block the ball...

03:58.547 --> 04:00.297
Let's go.

04:00.297 --> 04:03.280
- Let's go.
- Me too!

04:03.280 --> 04:04.927
Me too!

04:04.927 --> 04:07.135
- Hey!
- I gotta pee.

04:15.437 --> 04:18.479
I like Camus too. "The Stranger".

04:27.142 --> 04:29.252
"Maman died today."

04:31.122 --> 04:35.377
"Or yesterday maybe, I don't know."

04:36.880 --> 04:40.345
"I got a telegram from the home:"

04:43.213 --> 04:45.383
"Mother deceased."

04:45.383 --> 04:50.096
Àdieu is a compound word
with the preposition à and Dieu.

04:50.096 --> 04:53.963
In English, it's "to God". It means with God.

04:53.963 --> 04:58.922
Thus, it means though we part now,
let's meet again with God.

04:58.922 --> 05:04.205
In Korean, let's not meet till we die, jerk!

05:05.174 --> 05:06.797
Working hard on your projects?

05:06.797 --> 05:10.089
It's in place of the midterms. Do it well.

05:12.755 --> 05:14.088
Yes?

05:27.926 --> 05:30.755
[FRENCH LIT DUDES' CHAT GROUP]
Isn't she cool?

05:30.755 --> 05:33.005
Such confidence. She's a European all right.

05:33.005 --> 05:35.155
I think she just wants to stand out.

05:35.155 --> 05:37.588
Totally agreed.

05:37.588 --> 05:40.172
Anyway, she's mine.

05:45.688 --> 05:48.338
Is she really dating Olivier?

05:48.338 --> 05:49.630
Don't know.

05:49.630 --> 05:53.505
But I heard a comp sci sucker
does her assignments for her.

05:53.505 --> 05:55.213
- Really?
- Yeah.

05:55.213 --> 05:58.381
She smokes anywhere she wants
and lives so carefree.

05:58.381 --> 06:01.798
Hey, didn't she wear the same clothes yesterday?

06:37.731 --> 06:40.148
Just eat each other, why don't you!

06:44.338 --> 06:45.880
Hello.

06:56.463 --> 06:58.838
Hey. Let's just go for a drink.

07:02.406 --> 07:04.518
I don't drink with girls.

07:05.475 --> 07:06.851
Hey.

07:06.851 --> 07:09.267
Wanna do the team project with me?

07:10.279 --> 07:14.082
What? Think you caught my weakness?

07:14.082 --> 07:15.249
What?

07:15.249 --> 07:18.127
Not interested in being a sucker.
Find someone else.

07:24.802 --> 07:27.761
[TO OLIVIER]

07:29.582 --> 07:31.408
[ADIEU]

07:42.207 --> 07:44.666
[OUTING]

07:44.666 --> 07:48.733
[HAVING YOUR SEXUAL IDENTITY
REVEALED AGAINST YOUR WILL]

07:48.733 --> 07:50.736
[COMMITTING SUICIDE PAINLESSLY]

07:53.488 --> 08:00.123
Animals born albino can have physical defects,
and are often bullied by the herd.

08:00.123 --> 08:01.998
[SOLOMON'S STORY]

08:01.998 --> 08:07.332
Albinos were considered sacred,
but as they were not protected properly...

08:07.332 --> 08:11.233
- Mom.
- they had very low survival rates.

08:12.247 --> 08:15.165
- Got some money?
- Why?

08:15.165 --> 08:18.165
- I gotta go and live in the States.
- Why?

08:18.165 --> 08:20.832
I think it'll be hard to live here.

08:20.832 --> 08:24.290
Then you should've majored in English.

08:24.290 --> 08:27.115
- Then I'll go to France.
- Just go to the army.

08:37.373 --> 08:39.248
Did you hear?

08:50.473 --> 08:52.915
- No way!
- There's a witness.

08:52.915 --> 08:55.248
What? Someone saw him?

09:00.598 --> 09:02.040
I'm serious!

09:02.040 --> 09:03.998
- Bullshit!
- What is it?

09:03.998 --> 09:07.248
- He keeps saying weird stuff.
- It's true.

09:07.248 --> 09:08.415
You really saw him?

09:08.415 --> 09:11.915
I have perfect vision. I saw him!

09:11.915 --> 09:14.082
- You're saying Olivier is gay?
- What?

09:14.082 --> 09:16.815
I saw him go into a hotel with a guy!

09:16.815 --> 09:18.415
In Itaewon at that!

09:18.415 --> 09:19.998
- Gross!
- Yeah.

09:19.998 --> 09:22.624
- Not a girl with short hair?
- Yeah!

09:22.624 --> 09:27.333
No. He was this tall, skinny, and his face...

09:28.164 --> 09:30.082
What? Keep going.

09:30.082 --> 09:32.707
It was slim with narrow eyes.

09:34.769 --> 09:36.810
Just like him.

09:37.787 --> 09:38.745
Hey!

09:38.745 --> 09:41.453
I took this last night by mistake.

09:41.453 --> 09:46.857
You were so hilarious.
I woke up laughing because of you!

09:46.857 --> 09:48.482
You're so funny!

09:49.287 --> 09:51.745
Laugh will ya?

09:53.095 --> 09:54.953
- It was fun, right?
- Yeah.

09:54.953 --> 09:56.287
Hello.

09:56.287 --> 09:58.853
- Hello.
- See you later.

10:01.037 --> 10:03.037
It's okay, man.

10:06.262 --> 10:10.328
Our last class ended
before we got to Arthur Rimbaud.

10:10.328 --> 10:14.519
As I mentioned, Rimbaud is important
to modern French literature...

10:26.328 --> 10:27.870
A beer, please.

10:30.119 --> 10:31.745
What's wrong?

10:31.745 --> 10:33.493
Why?

10:33.493 --> 10:35.076
Are you mad?

10:36.370 --> 10:39.870
I'm not mad, just embarrassed.

10:44.159 --> 10:47.912
Nice lighter. Where'd you buy it?

10:47.912 --> 10:49.328
It's not mine.

10:49.328 --> 10:52.662
Really? Then give it to me.

10:52.662 --> 10:55.703
I'll give you a double shot of tequila for it.

11:09.220 --> 11:10.935
[NICE SCREENSHOT!]

11:10.935 --> 11:13.328
- They're KJH's boobs.
- Really?

11:13.328 --> 11:15.287
It's her for sure.

11:15.287 --> 11:16.620
How do you know?

11:16.620 --> 11:19.370
From the size and location
of the dot on the chest.

11:19.370 --> 11:20.703
It's totally her.

11:20.703 --> 11:22.912
Thought they'd be grapefruits,
but they're kiwis.

11:22.912 --> 11:23.995
- A.
- B.

11:23.995 --> 11:25.120
They're like tangerines.

11:25.120 --> 11:27.078
75B. They're mangos.

11:27.078 --> 11:30.078
[D F L T B]

11:39.381 --> 11:41.453
[JANG HEUNG SOO HAS LEFT THE CHAT]

11:41.453 --> 11:44.260
- What?
- Who's Jang Heung Soo?

11:44.260 --> 11:48.037
[D F L T B]
Don't Fucking Lie To Boobs?

11:48.037 --> 11:49.953
What does this mean?

11:49.953 --> 11:52.728
Cellphones off. We'll start soon.

11:52.728 --> 11:56.353
- Everyone saw the pic.
- Really?

11:58.327 --> 11:59.995
The boobs must be her.

11:59.995 --> 12:02.578
I'd drop out if I were her.

12:02.578 --> 12:03.687
Maybe she did!

12:03.687 --> 12:07.020
Close your books and clear your desks.

12:17.044 --> 12:19.920
I heard it's you. Slut.

12:19.920 --> 12:21.795
Quiet!

12:54.245 --> 12:56.473
[KOO JAE HEE]

13:10.495 --> 13:12.078
Quiet!

13:20.005 --> 13:21.197
Look!

13:21.197 --> 13:22.865
No dot.

13:22.865 --> 13:25.240
Full A-cup. Fuck!

13:37.124 --> 13:40.815
Koo Jae Hee's show later became a legend
in the French department

13:40.815 --> 13:45.476
and her nickname changed
from KJH to crazy bitch.

13:55.818 --> 13:57.592
Let's go for drinks.

14:23.865 --> 14:27.032
[Damn Fuckin' Losers Talking Bullshit]

14:35.907 --> 14:37.365
Here.

14:39.612 --> 14:40.353
Awesome!

14:40.353 --> 14:43.948
Born in Daegu, Jae Hee spent
her high school years in Paris.

14:43.948 --> 14:48.265
When she got drunk, she sang French songs.

14:48.265 --> 14:52.599
She was an overachiever
who'd even sell her scooter for more drinks.

14:52.599 --> 14:56.940
And was diligent enough to check
the sanitation of club bathrooms daily.

14:59.372 --> 15:04.844
Hey. Where'd you learn to act so cold and cranky?

15:04.844 --> 15:06.261
What?

15:06.261 --> 15:08.524
Don't you remember?

15:08.524 --> 15:12.401
"What? Think you caught my weakness?"

15:14.200 --> 15:16.200
When did I say that?

15:17.465 --> 15:18.870
Jang Heung Soo.

15:20.519 --> 15:26.935
How can being yourself be your weakness?

15:36.132 --> 15:38.193
Let's toast.

16:51.777 --> 16:57.188
We bonded with our natural outsider tendencies
and nightlife instincts.

16:57.188 --> 17:02.648
With nothing but our youth and stamina,
we spent like crazy and didn't calculate.

17:02.648 --> 17:07.398
5, 4, 3, 2, 1!

17:22.905 --> 17:25.490
Crazy bitch meets gay friend.

17:25.490 --> 17:29.490
And so began our wild life together.

17:42.680 --> 17:44.763
How much is rent here?

17:44.763 --> 17:47.888
Don't know. It's a deposit lease.

17:47.888 --> 17:49.014
Why?

17:49.014 --> 17:50.973
Just wondering.

17:52.097 --> 17:54.055
Let's eat.

17:58.877 --> 18:01.472
I don't think I can eat.

18:01.472 --> 18:03.080
I should quit drinking.

18:03.080 --> 18:06.205
Me too. I feel like throwing up.

18:07.278 --> 18:10.970
I'm never drinking again. If I do, I'm not human.

18:20.594 --> 18:22.136
I'm not human.

18:26.375 --> 18:28.625
Hurry up! Come on!

18:29.471 --> 18:34.805
Like in the movies, is it true Paris people
really don't care if you're gay?

18:34.805 --> 18:38.163
There are dimwits everywhere.
It's just less dense there.

18:38.163 --> 18:40.228
It's way too dense here.

18:53.992 --> 18:58.784
Then you went alone and lived
in someone else's house?

18:59.909 --> 19:02.325
Your parents must've worried a lot.

19:04.868 --> 19:08.803
My parents never came once while I was there.

19:08.803 --> 19:11.012
Not once in four years?

19:11.012 --> 19:15.303
They don't really care about me.

19:15.303 --> 19:17.763
They're too busy on their high horses.

19:17.763 --> 19:19.429
Dang.

19:21.404 --> 19:24.303
Why? Feel sorry for me?

19:24.303 --> 19:27.345
No, I'm fuckin' jealous.

19:29.612 --> 19:33.012
I wish Mom would stop caring
and just give me deposit money.

19:33.012 --> 19:34.637
Jeez.

19:34.637 --> 19:39.345
Hey! The deal was I move out and earn my own keep.

19:39.345 --> 19:41.845
You get an allowance.

19:46.886 --> 19:48.720
[HOW ARE YOU? I MISS YOU.]

19:48.720 --> 19:50.387
The DJ?

19:52.178 --> 19:54.512
"How are you? I miss you."

19:54.512 --> 19:56.286
Whatever!

19:56.286 --> 19:58.786
Say you met a big dude.

19:59.548 --> 20:03.156
How can I? He still loves me and is in pain.

20:03.156 --> 20:05.656
Love? Yeah, right!

20:06.817 --> 20:08.758
"Babe, lend me some money."

20:08.758 --> 20:11.717
Crazy! Stop! Give it to me!

20:13.925 --> 20:15.675
"How much?"

20:17.050 --> 20:18.842
"A grand."

20:21.050 --> 20:23.092
Why isn't he reading it?

20:24.417 --> 20:26.300
Cheap bastard.

20:26.300 --> 20:27.675
Here's your coffee.

20:27.675 --> 20:29.633
Thank you.

20:29.633 --> 20:31.925
I'll catch it. Throw it!

20:31.925 --> 20:32.758
Ow!

20:32.758 --> 20:34.508
Look where you're throwing!

20:34.508 --> 20:37.908
Oh, I'm so sorry. I passed but my friend missed.

20:37.908 --> 20:39.950
What the hell was...

20:42.967 --> 20:45.675
Let me buy you another cup of coffee.

20:48.692 --> 20:50.467
Why do you like that nerd?

20:50.467 --> 20:53.842
He's not a nerd. He's the head
of the basketball club.

20:53.842 --> 20:58.158
Just sleep with him and move on.
Dating is too much work.

20:58.158 --> 21:01.925
There's nothing more fun than dating.

21:01.925 --> 21:05.883
Dating is like red-colored clothes.

21:05.883 --> 21:11.616
You only wear it a few times,
but others think you wear it all the time.

21:11.616 --> 21:13.496
It's stupid.

21:14.733 --> 21:18.008
They count all the men you meet
and talk shit about you,

21:18.008 --> 21:21.550
when they don't know
you're a soft romantic at heart.

21:22.609 --> 21:24.467
Who cares?

21:24.467 --> 21:26.883
You know the real me.

21:29.091 --> 21:31.675
I don't care what others think.

21:31.675 --> 21:34.133
I'm going to try everything I can.

21:34.133 --> 21:36.840
I don't want to regret not doing things later.

21:41.963 --> 21:44.838
This makes you barf?

21:44.838 --> 21:46.755
No, no.

21:46.755 --> 21:49.547
I feel sick from lunch.

21:49.547 --> 21:51.338
Why you...

21:52.255 --> 21:55.130
Aren't you buying a shirt? Try one on.

21:56.130 --> 21:58.005
Everybody all right?

21:58.005 --> 22:00.630
All right!

22:01.421 --> 22:03.672
Alright, find your match!

22:03.672 --> 22:05.630
First time at a drink and meet?

22:05.630 --> 22:07.172
Pardon?

22:07.172 --> 22:09.422
Is it your first time here?

22:09.422 --> 22:11.302
No.

22:11.302 --> 22:14.297
I don't feel well. Excuse me.

22:14.297 --> 22:15.797
Excuse me.

22:18.713 --> 22:20.255
Hi, cutie!

22:20.255 --> 22:24.463
How about the loser
escorts the winner to heaven tonight?

22:32.088 --> 22:33.672
Are you okay?

22:37.587 --> 22:39.547
Oh, no! I'm so sorry.

22:39.547 --> 22:43.291
It's okay. I was going to throw 'em out anyway.

22:44.880 --> 22:46.672
Gucci shoes?

23:18.372 --> 23:20.377
Why'd you hold my hand without consent?

23:20.377 --> 23:23.818
I'm sorry. I got excited.

23:23.818 --> 23:26.901
I'm expressive with things I like.

23:27.584 --> 23:31.189
Forget it. I'm sensitive to stuff like that.

24:26.085 --> 24:28.085
[HEUNG SOO: CALL ME]

24:32.019 --> 24:33.668
Jeez.

24:33.668 --> 24:36.335
[KOO JAE HEE]

24:37.810 --> 24:39.502
Hi.

24:39.502 --> 24:43.752
Know what he said after walking me home tonight?

24:43.752 --> 24:45.902
Lend him some money?

24:45.902 --> 24:49.335
He asked if we could hold hands. Cute, huh?

24:49.335 --> 24:51.502
He's so pure and innocent.

24:51.502 --> 24:54.377
Guess that means you two didn't go too far.

24:54.377 --> 24:55.745
He's so sweet.

24:55.745 --> 24:59.103
He smells like soap and I almost threw up
because I got turned on.

24:59.103 --> 25:01.395
- I threw up for real.
- Why?

25:03.060 --> 25:07.120
That's enough, Sis. You sound like Mom.

25:07.120 --> 25:08.440
Is someone with you?

25:08.440 --> 25:09.540
Right.

25:09.540 --> 25:11.132
I'm on my way.

25:15.280 --> 25:19.196
My sister is mad at me. I'd better go.

25:19.196 --> 25:20.132
What's your name?

25:20.132 --> 25:22.995
Ah, my name is Kwon Su Ho.

25:22.995 --> 25:25.895
Let's go. I'll take you home.

25:25.895 --> 25:27.853
Where did you park your car?

25:32.994 --> 25:36.245
I'll repay you for the shoes.

25:36.245 --> 25:38.663
- It's okay. Don't worry.
- No.

25:39.569 --> 25:41.736
I'll repay you for sure.

26:14.787 --> 26:17.495
I can touch my elbow with my tongue.

26:22.287 --> 26:23.870
Oh...

26:33.720 --> 26:36.203
Someone was right outside that window.

26:36.203 --> 26:38.228
One of my panties is missing too.

26:38.228 --> 26:41.062
This is the third floor. You're crazy.

26:42.495 --> 26:44.828
No, I'm not.

26:52.512 --> 26:54.370
You said you went drinking. Why take a shower?

26:54.370 --> 26:56.745
I threw up!

26:56.745 --> 26:59.853
- I should quit drinking.
- Yeah, right.

26:59.853 --> 27:01.145
Dang.

27:02.912 --> 27:05.078
That's not it.

27:06.119 --> 27:08.412
Something smells sweet.

27:08.412 --> 27:10.412
Give me some details.

27:10.412 --> 27:12.578
Is he cute? How old is he?

27:12.578 --> 27:14.270
Don't know. I'm not seeing him again.

27:14.270 --> 27:16.312
Why? Did it suck?

27:20.137 --> 27:21.245
It was great.

27:21.245 --> 27:22.703
Really?

27:23.745 --> 27:25.245
Then why not date him?

27:25.245 --> 27:27.245
It totally hit me.

27:27.245 --> 27:30.037
He's the type to jump into love.

27:30.037 --> 27:31.390
I can't commit.

27:31.390 --> 27:33.599
Why is that a problem?

27:34.620 --> 27:36.245
Sleep over.

27:36.245 --> 27:38.370
It's okay. I'll go home.

27:38.370 --> 27:39.776
What are you, Cinderella?

27:39.776 --> 27:42.311
Our first class starts soon.

27:42.311 --> 27:44.228
I won't bite.

28:19.119 --> 28:20.953
This is a stone bed.

28:20.953 --> 28:23.412
Oh, no! Are you okay?

28:23.412 --> 28:26.621
No. I think I have a concussion.

28:26.621 --> 28:28.788
You look like an angel.

28:34.787 --> 28:36.245
Puppy!

28:36.245 --> 28:37.937
Sweetheart, where are you?

28:37.937 --> 28:39.942
It's gotta be a concussion.

28:39.942 --> 28:41.870
- I'm hearing things.
- I'm at my home!

28:41.870 --> 28:44.162
- I hear it too.
- Puppy!

28:44.162 --> 28:47.412
Why didn't you take your meds?

28:47.412 --> 28:49.537
Puppy!

28:49.537 --> 28:50.870
Sweetheart!

28:50.870 --> 28:52.120
Mommy?

28:52.120 --> 28:54.733
- You said she went on a trip.
- She did. Why is she here?

28:54.733 --> 28:55.925
What do we do?

28:55.925 --> 28:57.742
I'll just introduce myself.

28:57.742 --> 28:59.075
No!

29:00.845 --> 29:03.537
Where are you?

29:03.537 --> 29:04.671
- Hurry!
- Wait!

29:04.671 --> 29:06.037
Go!

29:07.553 --> 29:08.578
Mommy!

29:08.578 --> 29:11.245
Oh, my goodness! What happened?

29:11.245 --> 29:13.412
I was just stretching.

29:13.412 --> 29:15.370
I had no time to clean.

29:15.370 --> 29:17.745
I was going to clean before you came.

29:17.745 --> 29:20.078
Why are you here?

29:20.078 --> 29:22.245
The hospital paged your dad.

29:22.245 --> 29:23.663
Mommy's so sad.

29:23.663 --> 29:25.945
Don't worry.

29:25.945 --> 29:27.403
Mommy will clean. You go and study.

29:27.403 --> 29:28.445
It's okay!

29:28.445 --> 29:29.903
Wait.

29:29.903 --> 29:33.237
I'll do it. Mommy must be tired.

29:33.237 --> 29:34.553
So sweet!

29:34.553 --> 29:36.513
So sweet, my son!

29:36.513 --> 29:38.346
Grab my hands.

29:39.295 --> 29:41.237
Stand up.

29:41.237 --> 29:44.653
Go take your cold medication. You forgot.

29:44.653 --> 29:47.613
I'll clean this place perfectly!

29:47.613 --> 29:50.154
Go! Go! Go!

29:56.837 --> 30:00.320
What a pigsty.

30:00.320 --> 30:02.820
Why is the housekeeper off today!

30:18.528 --> 30:20.403
What's stuck?

30:24.528 --> 30:26.403
How embarrassing!

30:29.445 --> 30:32.945
So you borrowed his mom's dress
and came home?

30:33.861 --> 30:37.278
You should've seen the look on their faces.

30:37.278 --> 30:39.487
They stared like I was a rapist.

30:41.862 --> 30:46.195
If his mommy and I were drowning,
he wouldn't even look at me.

30:47.820 --> 30:48.678
Bastard.

